<?xml version="1.0" encoding="iso-8859-1"?>
<html>

  <head>
    <desc>
      <input type="hidden" class="HidParam" id="RPT_NAME" value="Kinney Drug Duplicate Invoice" /> <input type="hidden" class="HidParam" id="RPT_FILENAME" value="kdloc_sku_itm_qry_dup_inv" /> <input type="hidden" class="HidParam" id="RPT_PARENT" value="" /> <input type="hidden" class="HidParam" id="RPT_PRIORITY" value="" /> <input type="hidden" class="HidParam" id="RPT_DESC" value="" /> <input type="hidden" class="HidParam" id="RPT_GROUP" value="" /> <input type="hidden" class="HidParam" id="RPT_WIZARD" value="yes" />
    </desc>
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=iso-8859-1" />
    <meta name="CurHdr" content="ScreenRpt" />
    <meta http-equiv="expires" content="0" />
    <meta http-equiv="PRAGMA" content="No_Cache" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../../Images/pro_form.css" type="text/css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../../Images/pro_rpt.css" type="text/css" />
<script type="text/javascript" src="../../Images/rpt.js">
</script>

    <title></title>
  </head>

  <body onload="@wizset(CURPOS=null)InitRpt(document,@wizget(CURPOS),'@dbHot(DBALIAS)','@DBHOT(DBUSERNAME)','@DBHOT(DBPASSWORD)','http:/scripts/trs.exe');" class="Main">
    <div style="POSITION: absolute; BACKGROUND-COLOR: white; VISIBILITY: hidden; TOP: -200px; LEFT: 0px" id="gen_sets">
      @FMT(CMP,@WIZGET(STYPE)=2,®WIZRPL(PTYPE=0))<br />
    </div>
    <object id="cDialog" class="ComDialog" classid="clsid:327DC737-2BAD-48A3-9B4E-B42D5378C78A">
    </object> 

    <table class="HdrTab">
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <th id="RptTitle" class="HdrCel">Kinney Drug Duplicate Invoice</th>

          <th class="HdrBtnCel"><input accesskey="Z" onblur="LeaveField(this)" onkeydown="ReadKeyStroke(window,this)" class="HdrBtnNew" onfocus="ActivateField(this)" onclick="SubmitReport('@wizget(DN)')" name="BtnSubmit" value="Launch" type="button" /></th>

          <th class="HdrBtnCel"><input onblur="LeaveField(this)" onkeydown="ReadKeyStroke(window,this)" class="HdrBtnNew" onfocus="ActivateField(this)" onclick="document.location='http:/scripts/trs.exe?htt=Script\\' + RPT_FILENAME.value + '.rpt&amp;CN=@CNC&amp;TN=@TER';" name="BtnReset" value="Reset" type="button" /></th>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <input class="HidParam" name="SQI" value="Script\\kdloc_sku_itm_qry_dup_inv" type="hidden" /><input class="HidParam" name="CN" value="@CNC" type="hidden" /><input class="HidParam" name="TN" value="@TER" type="hidden" /><input class="HidParam" name="RPTDIR" value="Script" type="hidden" />

    <table style="POSITION: absolute; WIDTH: 227px; HEIGHT: 40px; TOP: 50px; LEFT: 10px" class="EntTab">
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <th class="EntHdr" colspan="3">INVOICE NUMBER</th>
        </tr>

        <tr>
          <td>FROM</td>

          <td class="EntInp"><input onblur="LeaveField(this)" style="WIDTH: 60px" onkeydown="ReadKeyStroke(window,this)" datasrc="@wizset(F222_FROM=0)" class="EntNum" onfocus="SaveValue(this)" name="F222_FROM" value="@wizget(F222_FROM)" /></td>

          <td class="EntVal"><input class="EntValTxt" tabindex="-1" readonly="readonly" value="@dbSELECT(SELECT F6000 FROM KINNEYINV_TAB WHERE F222='@wizget(F222_FROM)')" /></td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
          <td>TO</td>

          <td class="EntInp"><input onblur="LeaveField(this)" style="WIDTH: 60px" onkeydown="ReadKeyStroke(window,this)" datasrc="@wizset(F222_TO=0)" class="EntNum" onfocus="SaveValue(this)" name="F222_TO" value="@wizget(F222_TO)" /></td>

          <td class="EntVal"><input class="EntValTxt" tabindex="-1" readonly="readonly" value="@dbSELECT(SELECT F6000 FROM KINNEYINV_TAB WHERE F222='@wizget(F222_TO)')" /></td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <p> </p>

    <table style="POSITION: absolute; WIDTH: 227px; HEIGHT: 40px; TOP: 120px; LEFT: 10px" class="EntTab">
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>

    <p>Insure you have the focus on the new batch # in the Batch Header Window, which you are planning to copy items from an existing invoice number</p>

    <p>All items items containing the original invoice number you enter in the FROM will be duplicated in the new batch under the new invoice number you enter in the TO. 
You must create the new invoice number before you enter it.
</p>

   
    </td></tr></tbody></table>
  </body>
</html>

